spans.s:
स्फुट a. open, blossomed, blown;
 clear, distinct, plain.
Abstr. ˚ता f. ˚त्व n.

स्फुर् स्फुर॑ति स्फुर॑˚ते pp. स्फुरित jerk, dart,
kick (tr. & intr.);
 quiver, tremble, glitter,
[]
sparkle, start into
view, appear, arise. — अप snap away, withdraw quickly. अव & निस्
hurl away. परि quiver, throb;
 glitter, shine;
 rise, appear. प्र
kick or hurl away, shake, tremble, quiver etc. = prec. वि fly asunder;
tremble, quiver = prec.

स्फुरण a. glittering, sparkling;
 n. the action of
quivering, trembling, glittering, shining forth, appearing.

स्फुरित a. throbbing, trembling, palpitating,
glittering, sparkling;
 risen, appeared;
 n. = prec. n.

स्फूर्ज् स्फू॑र्जति pp. स्फूर्जित rumble, roar,
thunder;
 burst forth, appear. C. स्फृर्ज॑यति crackle, rustle.
—अभि & अव roar, thunder. वि rumble, snort;
 break forth, appear. —
Cf. विस्फूर्जित.
